यह रहे Active & Passive Voice पर आधारित 25 महत्वपूर्ण प्रश्न (MCQs) – SSC CGL, CHSL, GD आदि परीक्षाओं के लिए, उत्तर सहित हिंदी में:


---

✅ Active – Passive Voice MCQs (With Answers)

📘 Basic Level (Level 1)

1. She writes a letter. (Passive)
a) A letter was written by her.
b) A letter is written by her.
c) A letter is being written by her.
d) A letter has been written by her.
✅ उत्तर: b) A letter is written by her.




---

2. They are playing football. (Passive)
a) Football is played by them.
b) Football was being played by them.
c) Football is being played by them.
d) Football has been played by them.
✅ उत्तर: c) Football is being played by them.




---

3. The manager gave me a bonus. (Passive)
a) A bonus was given me by the manager.
b) I was given a bonus by the manager.
c) A bonus is given by the manager.
d) A bonus was being given to me.
✅ उत्तर: b) I was given a bonus by the manager.




---

4. He has completed the project. (Passive)
a) The project is completed by him.
b) The project was completed by him.
c) The project has been completed by him.
d) The project will be completed by him.
✅ उत्तर: c) The project has been completed by him.




---

5. Do you like mangoes? (Passive)
a) Are mangoes liked by you?
b) Mangoes are liked by you.
c) Do mangoes liked by you?
d) Were mangoes liked by you?
✅ उत्तर: a) Are mangoes liked by you?




---

📘 Intermediate Level (Level 2)

6. They were watching a movie. (Passive)
✅ A movie was being watched by them.


7. She had finished her homework. (Passive)
✅ Her homework had been finished by her.


8. The police caught the thief. (Passive)
✅ The thief was caught by the police.


9. Will she help us? (Passive)
✅ Will we be helped by her?


10. The teacher is teaching the students. (Passive)
✅ The students are being taught by the teacher.




---

📘 Advanced MCQs (With Modals & Imperatives)

11. You must complete the task. (Passive)
✅ The task must be completed by you.


12. Open the door. (Passive)
✅ Let the door be opened.


13. Do not waste time. (Passive)
✅ Let time not be wasted.


14. Please help me. (Passive)
✅ You are requested to help me.


15. She can speak English. (Passive)
✅ English can be spoken by her.




---

📚 Fill in the Blanks Type

16. The letter ___ by him. (write – Present Perfect)
✅ has been written


17. The book ___ by Shakespeare. (write – Past Simple)
✅ was written


18. A song ___ by her now. (sing – Present Continuous)
✅ is being sung


19. The work ___ by tomorrow. (finish – Future Perfect)
✅ will have been finished


20. He ___ a car. (drive – Passive, Simple Present)
✅ A car is driven by him.




---

🔟 Miscellaneous MCQs

21. The students ___ (teach) by the professor yesterday.
✅ were taught


22. The cake ___ (bake) by Ritu.
✅ was baked


23. They ___ (inform) about the meeting.
✅ have been informed


24. A letter ___ (type) by the clerk.
✅ is being typed


25. My wallet ___ (steal) last night.
✅ was stolen




